# Runaway process monitor rules — one per line: <action> <name or glob>
# The pattern matches the process name (e.g. mediaanalysisd) or its full path.
# First matching rule wins. Manage with: runaway-monitor ignore|throttle|pause-on-battery|unrule
#
# Actions:
#   ignore            never alert
#   throttle          when hot, demote to background priority (efficiency cores, low I/O) — no dialog
#   pause-on-battery  when hot on battery, pause it (SIGSTOP); resume automatically on AC power.
#                     On AC it's left alone with no alert.
#
# Examples:
# pause-on-battery mediaanalysisd
# pause-on-battery photoanalysisd
# throttle mds_stores
# ignore *ffmpeg*
